The test setup did not fill in the values used by the product and layout assertions. The Shop page visibly shows four products, prices, and Add to cart buttons, while the layout panel shows zero issues, but the automated checks received placeholder text instead of those results.
Repair the test's check-variable bindings and require the agent to return layout_report as the full panel text. Anchor the failure at step 0-5: the product-listing assertion was blocked by unresolved placeholders, not by a Shop control.
